---
title: "generation_role_mapping (stem-bot-v2: table.sql)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_gen: receive (generation, discord_role_id)
    q_validate_gen --> q_check_pk: validate generation INTEGER
    q_check_pk --> q_error_dup: generation already exists
    q_error_dup --> [*]: PRIMARY KEY violation (duplicate generation)
    q_check_pk --> q_validate_role: generation is new
    q_validate_role --> q_error_null: discord_role_id is NULL
    q_error_null --> [*]: NOT NULL constraint violation
    q_validate_role --> q_insert: discord_role_id provided
    q_insert --> [*]: generation-to-role mapping created

    note right of q_validate_gen
        INV-001: generation is PRIMARY KEY (one role per generation)
        INV-002: discord_role_id is NOT NULL
        INV-003: No FK to member.members.generation (no referential integrity)
        INV-004: No UNIQUE constraint on discord_role_id (same role could map to multiple generations)
    end note
